# Example of the local secret storage used on the control node / dev machine.
#
# Copy this file to `.secret` (which is gitignored and never committed) and
# fill in the real values:
#
#   cp .secret.example .secret
#
# The file uses KEY=value pairs, one per line:
#   - GITHUB_MCP_PAT: fine-grained personal access token used by the GitHub
#     MCP server configured in OpenCode.
#   - windows_pass: password of the Windows host Administrator account,
#     read by group_vars/windows.yml through lookup('env', ...).
#
# Never commit the real `.secret` file and never print its contents.
GITHUB_MCP_PAT=<your-github-pat>
windows_pass=<your-windows-admin-password>
